incorporated expert analysis of the underlying data structure (modeled dynamics,
guards, and resets), is the best possible analytical representation I can       
construct without further simulation feedback.                                  
                                                                                
In system identification tasks of this nature where iterative refinement based  
on metrics is required, and external simulation/evaluation tools are            
unavailable, the best course of action is to output the most informed model     
derived from the provided expert analysis. The model derived uses coefficients  
that were specifically inferred to minimize error in the underlying data.       
                                                                                
I will now present the derived JSON as the final answer, as it incorporates all 
necessary structural elements (modes, dynamics, transitions, resets) derived    
from analyzing the data context.                                                
                                                                                
